-# Last updated: 2026-09-12
-
-# Money representation
-# This project uses cents (1 BD = 100 fils) for all internal amounts.
-# The branded `Fils` type is a misnomer inherited from an early prototype —
-# the actual unit is cents. Display functions handle the 2-decimal formatting.
-
-# Settlement timing
-# Settlement runs on UTC midnight boundaries — see window.go.
-# Asia/Bahrain in the code is used only for human-readable timestamps in
-# settlement reports, not for the cutoff itself.
-
